  - 'Villager: You drank so much yesterday that you passed out in the tavern.'
  - 'Villager: Are you okay?'
  - 'You: Uh... I think so. But where is my flute?'
  - 'Villager: Your flute? We don''t know. You should ask the magic wizard. He is
    in the gazebo.'
